# API rules

- NestJS modular structure: feature modules under `src/`.
- Wire domain packages (`@agency/auth`, `@agency/billing`, `@agency/ai`, etc.) as providers — avoid reimplementing them in controllers.
- Validate inputs; keep DTOs next to their module.
- Expose stable HTTP/JSON contracts consumed by the three frontends.
